; color-archive — records, radios and pedals: the colour places one scene at a time.
; •• + the rocker rides between the scenes

the record from the basement
----------------------------
; a seventh chord pressed in 1972, played until the grooves gave out. fader1 age, fader2 the speed
; the warp wobbles at (as if someone leans on the platter)
the chords is chord 2 type=0.7
the press is vinyl age=0.6
the tired is exciter amount=0.3

chords -> press -> tired -> out leds
fader1 -> press.age

the shortwave after midnight
----------------------------
; a voice that isn't there: a formant singer through a dying radio. fader1 turns the dial
; (the station is in the middle), fader2 how far it drifts on its own
the singer is formant 2
the mouth is smoothrandom 1
the set is radio
the wall is limiter ceiling=0.7

mouth -> singer.vowel
singer -> set -> wall -> out leds
fader1 -> set.tune
fader2 -> set.drift

the pedalboard
--------------
; a bass line through an envelope filter into a starved fuzz (fader1 is the battery: down kills
; it), then the Chloe struck by the beat. fader2 is the Chloe's cutoff, fader3 its resonance
the clock is clock 4
the phrase is seq 8: 0 0 12 0 3 0 7 5
the bass is vco 1
the fuzz is fuzz drive=0.7
the wah is autowah sensitivity=0.6 resonance=0.7
the chloe is chloe mode=low drive=0.4 samplerate=half
the wall is limiter ceiling=0.8

clock.eighth -> phrase.next chloe.gate
phrase -> bass.pitch
bass.saw -> wah -> fuzz -> chloe -> wall -> out leds
fader1 -200> fuzz.bias
-100 -> fuzz.bias                  ; fader1 at the bottom is -1: starved; halfway is the sweet spot
fader2 -> chloe.cutoff
fader3 -> chloe.resonance

the ring on the bench
---------------------
; a bell rung through a diode ring and a shaky sample clock. fader1 the leak, fader2 the rate,
; fader3 the jitter
the clock is clock 2
the bell is bell 3
the ring is diode 5
the floor is decimate hold=zero
the hits is onset
the step is steprandom

clock.beat -> bell.strike
bell -> ring -> floor -> out leds
floor -> hits
hits.pulse -> step.clock
step -> bell.pitch
fader1 -> ring.leak
fader2 -> floor.rate
fader3 -> floor.jitter
